SUMMARY:EduCore — ADR-012 Exception Review (Identity & Tenant)
DESCRIPTION:EDUCORE GOVERNANCE — ADR-012 EXCEPTION REVIEW\n\nPurpose:\nReview the time-bounded Identity & Tenant architecture exception (ADR-012) under Conditional Freeze. Decide Renew / Amend / Expire. Reaffirm that Nest Identity/Tenant product HTTP remains NO GO. Confirm path to full DBF-001 and ACF-001 Freeze v1.0 before hard expiry 2026-09-15.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThis meeting does NOT accept Database Freeze v1.0 or API Contract Freeze v1.0.\nThis meeting does NOT open product HTTP routes.\n\nRequired attendees:\n• Principal Architect / Governance Lead (Host)\n• PM Master — Database Architect\n• Masoud Salum — Security Lead\n• Rashid Mohammed — Backend Lead\n\nPre-read (before the meeting):\n1) docs/engineering/governance/ADR-012_ONE_PAGE_SUMMARY.md\n2) docs/engineering/decisions/ADR-012-exception-identity-tenant-implementation.md\n3) docs/engineering/gates/FREEZE_ACCEPTANCE_IDENTITY_TENANT.md\n4) Role section in docs/engineering/governance/IDENTITY_TENANT_GOVERNANCE_ACTION_PLAN.md\n\nCountersign ADR-012 by Friday 2026-08-08 (before this meeting if possible).\n\nAgenda (75 minutes):\n00–05  Framing: exception ≠ Freeze v1.0 (Host)\n05–15  Countersignature status check (Host)\n15–30  Security residuals — RLS\, live evidence\, HTTP closed (Masoud Salum)\n30–45  Schema / DBF fidelity & rework risk (PM Master)\n45–55  Backend scope control & OpenAPI readiness (Rashid Mohammed)\n55–70  Decision: Renew / Amend / Expire + Freeze v1.0 path by 2026-09-01 (All)\n70–75  Actions\, owners\, Nest HTTP NO GO reaffirmation in minutes (Host)\n\nRequired outcomes:\n• Recorded decision (Renew / Amend / Expire)\n• Named follow-ups with owners and dates\n• Explicit HTTP NO GO statement in meeting minutes\n\nBinding ADR review-by date: 2026-08-15\nHard expiry if not renewed: 2026-09-15\nAlternate slot if needed: Tuesday 2026-08-12\, 14:00–15:15 EAT\n\nBefore sending this invite: replace example.invalid emails and set LOCATION to the real video link.
